{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51662","headline":"题罗隐壁 · 钱鏐","name":"题罗隐壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"特到儒门谒老莱，老莱相见意徘徊。\n黄河信有澄清日，後代应难继此才。\n（以上《吴越钱氏传芳集》）（〖1〗钱泳案：「《吴越备史》云：『隐寝疾，王亲临抚问。\n因题其壁云：「黄河信有澄清日，後代应难继此才。\n」隐起而续末句云：「门外旌旗屯虎豹，壁间章句动风雷。\n」由是以红纱罩覆於其上。\n』」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}